			"notes": "# Contract Blade 1.0.6\n\n## New\n\n- Added the Hound Blade and Cat Blade. Each stores one of its owner's tamed\n  wolves or cats and releases the same pet on use.\n- Preserved the pet's identity, name, appearance, health, and owner data across\n  storage and release. Bound blades do not break from combat wear.\n- Added original pixel-art textures with editable SVG sources, crafting recipes,\n  and a Patchouli handbook page for the pet blades.\n\n## Handbook\n\n- Removed the Contract Blade handbook's automatic login grant.\n- Replaced its obsolete recipe ingredient with an amethyst shard. With\n  Patchouli installed, craft it from a book and an amethyst shard.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Minecraft 1.20.1\n- Forge 47.x\n- Touhou Little Maid 1.1.7+\n- Patchouli is optional and only needed for the handbook."
		}
